<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάραθρον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[βᾰ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέρεθρον</span></b>  (q. v., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέρεθρον</span>), shortd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέθρον</span></b>  (q. v.), τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gulf, pit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				947a19
			</span></i>; esp.at Athens, <i>a cleft</i> into which criminals were
			thrown, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.133
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1450
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				24.10
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				516c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				219
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				431
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ β. χειμάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					8.45
				</span></i>
			; <i>ruin, perdition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, etc.; name of a courtesan, Theophil.Com.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a woman's
				<i>ornament,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				320.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράθυ</span>
			, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόρατον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.76
			</span></i>. (Root <i>gseq[uglide]er</i> 'devour', cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βορά.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
